  "body": "Contemporary style · coastal charm · easy living\r\n\r\nWelcome to 1 Moko Road, Orewa — a brand-new, single-level home designed for modern living. Set on a corner site, this home combines contemporary design, quality finishes and a practical layout to create a comfortable and inviting space. Enjoy easy, low-maintenance living in one of Auckland’s popular coastal communities, with Orewa Beach, local cafés and everyday amenities all close by.\r\n\r\n• Schools & education\r\nConveniently located near local schooling options, including Nukumea Primary School, Orewa Primary School and Orewa College — all within approximately a 5-minute drive. With educational facilities nearby, this location offers added convenience for families looking to settle in the beautiful Orewa community.\r\n\r\n• Easy single-level living\r\nDesigned for comfortable, modern living, this brand-new single-level home features three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite, plus a second bathroom and a single internal-access garage.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 261.65sqm corner site, with a floor area of approximately 100sqm, the home offers a spacious garden with plenty of room for outdoor entertaining, gardening or simply enjoying the sunshine.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area is light and welcoming, with stylish cabinetry and quality Bosch appliances. Sliding doors open out to a rear deck, creating an easy indoor-outdoor flow — ideal for summer BBQs, entertaining friends or relaxing in the sun.\r\n\r\nTwo heat pumps help keep the home comfortable throughout the seasons, while the internal-access garage with a dedicated laundry area adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWith its modern design, quality features and practical single-level layout, this home is a great choice for those looking to enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle in Orewa.\r\n\r\n• Features & highlights\r\nMaster Build 10-Year Guarantee for added peace of mind;\r\nPremium Bosch dishwasher and oven for quality and convenience.\r\n\r\n\r\n• A lifestyle you'll love\r\nJust a short drive from Orewa Beach, local cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, this home offers a wonderful balance of coastal relaxation and everyday convenience. Enjoy morning beach walks, coffee at your favourite café and quality time with family, all within easy reach of home.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a comfortable place for your family or a smart property investment, this brand-new home at 1 Moko Road offers a great opportunity to enjoy modern living in one of Auckland's popular coastal communities.\r\n\r\nA place to feel at home. A lifestyle to love.",
